*   Container & Component Diagrams (PlantUML, docs/diagrams/container.puml & component.puml) – Detail Quarkus modules, worker pods, queues (Created in `I1.T2`, refined in `I2.T2`).
*   Database ERD (Mermaid, docs/diagrams/erd.mmd) – Capture multi-tenant schema with RLS expectations (Created in `I1.T3`, extended `I3.T3`).
*   OpenAPI Specification (YAML, `api/storefront-admin-platform.yaml`) – Spec-first contracts for storefront/admin/platform/headless (Bootstrapped `I1.T4`, iteratively expanded `I2.T3`, `I3.T2`).
*   Async Job Contract Catalogue (Markdown, `docs/async/job-catalog.md`) – Enumerate DelayedJob payloads, priorities, idempotency rules (Authored `I2.T4`).
*   Feature Flag Governance Matrix (Markdown, `docs/governance/feature-flags.md`) – Owner/expiry/state per flag (Created `I1.T5`).
*   Deployment & Ops Architecture Diagram (PlantUML, docs/diagrams/deployment.puml) – Show GitHub Actions → K8s + cert-manager + workers (Created `I4.T4`).
*   Media Processing Flow Diagram (Mermaid sequence, `docs/diagrams/media-flow.mmd`) – Outline upload → processing → storefront consumption (Created `I3.T4`).
*   POS Offline Sync Flow Diagram (Mermaid sequence, `docs/diagrams/pos-offline.mmd`) – Document offline queue/resolution handshake (Created `I4.T3`).
*   Reporting Data Flow & Retention Doc (Markdown, `docs/data/reporting-retention.md`) – Partitioning + archival + export specs (Created `I5.T2`).

